This plugin vendors three skills from Matt Pocock's "Skills for Real Engineers":

    https://github.com/mattpocock/skills

    skills/engineering/grill-with-docs   -> skills/grill-with-docs
    skills/productivity/grilling         -> skills/grilling
    skills/engineering/domain-modeling   -> skills/domain-modeling

Vendored verbatim (including each skill's agents/openai.yaml) from upstream commit:

    ed37663cc5fbef691ddfecd080dff42f7e7e350d

Only these three are vendored: `grill-with-docs` is a thin wrapper that runs
`/grilling` using the `/domain-modeling` skill, so the three form the minimal
closure. Upstream ships 41 skills; the rest are deliberately not carried here.

To re-sync, clone upstream and copy those three directories over, then update the
commit SHA above.

